corrupted lizard man~
a corrupted lizardman~
This lizardman's scales are rotting, it has been dead for centuries.
~
This lizardman has been dead for centuries, maybe even thousands of years. The
water in the tunnels seem to have kept it well preserved.  The scales are
rotting and the creature is missing large pieces of his chest and torso.  The
creature does not seem to recognize you, it has little intelligence left.
~
