A Leech's Hive~
The swamp floor gives way as the soft mud and sand pushes you down.  You are
in a hallow of some type, naturally occurred and only reinforced by the random
twigs, leaves, and bones.  The smell of rot and acid is heavy here as you
notice the walls are moving, thousands of larvae are waiting for their meal.
~
