#2982
The Forgotten Ruins~
This hallway has been flooded for centuries, the limestone walls have long
since corroded into a wall of moss.  It seems solid enough to maintain the
integrity of the ruins, although you wonder for how long.  The flooded tunnels
make it impossible to tell just how long this place has been buried.
~
