#2985
The Birthing Cavern~
This cavern is as large as you've seen in this place.  It is obviously a
natural formation as there is no sign of damage or wear.  Small, neat alcoves
are carved into the walls of the cavern and judging by the amount of bones,
the bones of small things, you guess this used to be a nursery or some sort.
~
